### redirection placed inside the exec action
find . -name '*.md' -exec echo {} > listing.txt \;
>>> SC2227 1:35

### redirection after the terminator applies to find
find . -name '*.md' -exec echo {} \; > listing.txt
>>> none

### redirection inside the sh -c script
find . -name '*.md' -execdir sh -c 'wc -l "$1" > counts.txt' _ {} \;
>>> none
